5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time we lose just getting set up every single morning.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Before we move anything, I want to see the actual monthly cost of this floor space.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We should decide who gets the worse seats on purpose, not by accident.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I care about the noise level and chair comfort more than the floor plan.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Who sits next to whom changes how we talk to each other all week.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, does the cost include the time we spend moving boxes?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, no, but the billing basis might explain why we have empty desks.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, comfort is valid, but we need to address the fairness of the layout.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, fairness is subjective. I just want a quiet, ergonomic spot.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I agree. We should look at how the current layout affects our chats.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m worried about the transition period. It could be chaotic.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the billing records. It’s been static for too long.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I want to see the survey results to see what people actually complained about.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll look at the sound readings. The printer side is too loud.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check what the new joiners said about how they learned the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,Let’s see what the pilot floor did. They’ve been doing this for a while.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. The data will tell us if this is worth the budget.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll also look at the unplanned shuffles from last year. They were a mess.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I’ll check the physio notes. My back hurts if the chair is wrong.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’ll look at the badge records. Arrival times matter for who gets the good spots.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
