35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The pilot floor takes up to nine minutes just to set up. That’s huge.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"We are paying for empty space. 41,000 yen a month for two unused desks.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The plan gives only four windows.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The printer side is nine decibels louder. And my chair takes days to adjust properly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The new joiners learned by overhearing. If we scatter them, they won’t learn.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we pay for empty space, maybe we don’t need as many desks?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, exactly. But moving a desk costs 6,200 yen. We need to be careful.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if the printer side is loud, we should assign those seats to people who don’t mind.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I don’t mind, but I need the chair to be right. It’s a long process.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, if we group by function, the new joiners might not hear the right things.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,The unplanned shuffles took two weeks each time. We can’t afford that again.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The cost of changing the layout is high. We need a stable plan.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The survey is clear. People want windows. We have to decide who gets them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,I prefer a fixed spot. Moving my setup is a pain.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"If we use first-come, first-served, the early birds get the windows. That’s unfair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I think we need a system that accounts for arrival times and comfort.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We need to minimize the cost of changes and maximize fairness.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let’s look at the options. We need to be deliberate about who sits where.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,I’m leaning towards fixed desks. It’s less hassle for me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried about the social aspect. We need to keep the team connected.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
